{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_043kaz_2_1_2_043_22_t01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:497f4733d9e44475abf50c748f5d6caa771f6cdb345bef3368e128335103f663",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_043kaz_2_1_2_043_22_t01:1_2_043_22_t01:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5bea75f2f57a415798ac87ba570ad525a59c127507f31417b66d032e771637e9",
      "text": "……制作人，今天谢谢你。\n为了我，准备了各种各样的事情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_043kaz_2_1_2_043_22_t01:1_2_043_22_t01:cmd-000014:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e299e0163eb60fbe87a909c0220d538304bcf3fed98514606d8c8ccbb02a37d9",
      "text": "能让您高兴\n真是太好了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_043kaz_2_1_2_043_22_t01:1_2_043_22_t01:cmd-000015:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd134a66653d185990c12b0095ae97d84519e043a9ecef1b98e9bfa8dcd19168",
      "text": "能一起庆祝\n真是太好了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_043kaz_2_1_2_043_22_t01:1_2_043_22_t01:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:751dff56a82f70ceb6aef1655e7afdd9bc559519d6f423db51edaf4237be5e0c",
      "text": "……我真的很开心哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_043kaz_2_1_2_043_22_t01:1_2_043_22_t01:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:334f0d50ae2c8b0b78231ec3bbbf5436e91ef3812647dec2c35daf3e2a2575d2",
      "text": "……说起生日……前阵子，凉和大吾为我准备的\n巡礼之旅，也很有意思。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_043kaz_2_1_2_043_22_t01:1_2_043_22_t01:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a6b899220bb5267405c38760215e68158820b5b2a7cbf8e75a16ab4a5347a6e",
      "text": "……他们帮我策划了一场\n巡访我喜欢的小说圣地的旅程。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_043kaz_2_1_2_043_22_t01:1_2_043_22_t01:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3178c9ed7349bad5ba8ddf9f447bffa84e879f11fc8d822f1ce9f93a4aa9559e",
      "text": "……全是些我曾经随口提过想去的地方。加上是和他们两个人一起，度过了非常充实的一天。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_043kaz_2_1_2_043_22_t01:1_2_043_22_t01:cmd-000027:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67cc1ae40401aa05512bf1836f7c13b8e6fb34175eb95522480f1bde9207030b",
      "text": "那可真是度过了\n美好的一天呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_043kaz_2_1_2_043_22_t01:1_2_043_22_t01:cmd-000030:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b183159ac22dc0be73841f0fc25a8984672b2688184a3436faa25673b8b1c3bf",
      "text": "……嗯，非常充实。\n旅途中他们两个人若无其事的细心体贴，让我很感动。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_043kaz_2_1_2_043_22_t01:1_2_043_22_t01:cmd-000032:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b63a9b986add792bc23915b37910f9460e583fb41b464dc270a4771ff39c0125",
      "text": "……包括今天在内，度过了一个非常美好的生日。\n再次向你致谢。……那么，改天见。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
